B.Go=new A.hc("Looks like your swing is a bit slow \u2014 stay loose and let the racket speed up through contact.","Looks like your swing speed is low \u2014 relax your grip and swing through the ball, not at it.",null,null,"Good racket-hand speed \u2014 keep it up.")
B.Gn=new A.hc(null,null,"Looks like your racket path wobbles a bit through contact \u2014 aim for one smooth line.","Looks like your racket path wanders through contact \u2014 slow down and groove one smooth swing.","Smooth, clean swing path \u2014 keep it up.")
B.Gl=new A.hc(null,null,"Your head moves a little during the swing \u2014 keep it still and watch the contact point.","Your head moves a lot during the swing \u2014 keep it still until after you hit.","Nice steady head \u2014 keep it up.")
B.Gi=new A.hc("Finish a little higher \u2014 let the racket come up over your shoulder.","Your swing stops low \u2014 follow through all the way up over your opposite shoulder.","Your finish is a bit high \u2014 extend forward toward your target before the racket comes up.","Your finish shoots straight up \u2014 drive forward through the ball before you finish.","Full, complete finish \u2014 keep it up.")
